      "updated": 1782488626769,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "UNIT OF WORK:\nTransactions should work, on\nDB_Transactions, based on Unit\nOf work:\nThat means that We have an\n\"entity\" that gathers all necessary\ndb_transactions or even\ntransactions, and executes them in\na flow, if any fail, then all fail, and\nif they all pass they are saved\nlineary together in DB.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "hiYlE3wQpsDbXcOIHsAsK",
      "originalText": "UNIT OF WORK:\nTransactions should work, on DB_Transactions, based on Unit Of work:\nThat means that We have an \"entity\" that gathers all necessary db_transactions or even transactions, and executes them in a flow, if any fail, then all fail, and if they all pass they are saved lineary together in DB.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
